            "prompt": "Create a COMPLETE OPAQUE full-background portrait4:5 painting, target1280x1600. Every pixel of the image fully opaque and naturally painted, including all corners. No alpha transparency anywhere. This is a finished scene, NOT a cutout or atlas. Dimensional warm storybook digital illustration, soft visible paint texture, exquisite natural details, gentle upper-left sunshine. No text, labels, logos, landmarks, people, frame, UI or watermark. Cozy lavender garden with a chipped blue enamel watering can beside an old blue gardenbench. Clear sky blue painted plasterwall occupies upper60% and bench midright alsoblue, so blue is the dominantpalette, withselect sagegreen andlavenderpurple plants. Cream pavingground with completewarmshadows. Smalltopstrip opaque pale blue sky. Thinbarebranchfromestablishedtreeleftendsaroundx25%,y23%, anotherbarerearshrubtwigendnearx79%,y30%, leaveboth tips withoutforegroundleafclusters. Lowerleftsoilpatchnearx19%,y86% andlowerrightsoilx82%,y88% provide natural rootpositions forlaterlavenderandgrass. No cloud in the little skystrip. All surroundinggardenattractivecomplete, no erasedholes. Later movingdetails omittedfromthisbackgroundare two leavesprigs, smalllavenderstem, grasstuft, littlecloud. Againfullyopaque cleanly painted skyandground, no artificialedgegrain.",
